@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Local dependency patch
+
+Upstream: portable-pty 0.9.0 from the locked crates.io archive.
+Archive SHA-256: `b4a596a2b3d2752d94f51fac2d4a96737b8705dddd311a32b9af47211f08671e`.
+
+Adds an opt-in Windows-only `CommandBuilder::set_start_suspended` setting,
+default false, forwarded as CREATE_SUSPENDED to the existing ConPTY CreateProcessW.
+The application assigns its Job Object before resuming the owned primary thread.
+This closes the previous post-spawn assignment gap without changing terminal stacks.
+Unix behavior and all other defaults are unchanged. The upstream MIT license is
+retained. Remove the patch when upstream offers an equivalent pre-execution hook.
